<title>USA: Alpine group ups Multi-Market Radio stake.</title>
<headline>Alpine group ups Multi-Market Radio stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Alpine Associates said Tuesday it raised its stake in Multi-Market Radio Inc to 302,200 class A common shares or 9.4 percent of the class outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought 52,500 additional class A shares on August 21 and 22 at prices ranging from $11.75 to $11.84375 a share or $619,375.</p>
</text>
